          </div>
          <p style="font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--muted); margin: 0; line-height: 1.65;">Dividends, interest payments, and returns from investment portfolios (stocks, bonds, mutual funds, ETFs). Regular, consistent payments are best — a pattern over 6–12 months strengthens your application. If your investment income fluctuates, provide a 12-month average and clear statements showing the pattern. <a href="/nlv-passive-income/" style="color: var(--red); font-weight: 700;">See passive income documentation requirements →</a></p>
